>I'm still alive, but I screwed up.  I thought what I had was an
>oilskin bag, but it was just a regular bag.  And I swam all the way
>around to the back and then over to the front again.  Yeah, you know
>what happened.  Anyway, I cleared out the castle and found the WoW. 
>Any ideas as to what I should wish for?  

With 25 unlabeled scrolls and 9 spellbooks, magic markers come to mind.

(Why were you carrying all this stuff around anyway? As a Bar, you have
no need for spellbooks, and surely amond the scrolls were scrolls of
fire, punishment and so on. These items are best left in a stash, for
later cleaning and writing.)

>The first thing is probably
>the 2 blessed scrolls of charging, but what after that?  

Identify the wand of wishing. You do not want it to turn to dust on the
next zap. If you know scrolls of charging, wish for a blessed magic
marker instead.

> f - an uncursed +0 polished silver shield (being worn)
> g - a blessed +1 apron (being worn)
> l - a blessed +4 gray dragon scale mail (being worn)
> z - an uncursed +2 pair of leather gloves (being worn)
> E - a cursed thoroughly rusty +1 dwarvish iron helm (being worn)
> W - a blessed +1 pair of speed boots (being worn)

Instead of leather gloves, gauntlets of power are be useful for a
pack-rat ascension. Scrolls of enchant armour can lower your AC enough.

> a - 11982 gold pieces

Buy protection.

> c - a triangular amulet
> d - an uncursed octagonal amulet
> i - a brass ring
> j - an uncursed wooden ring
> l - an uncursed wooden ring
> m - an uncursed thoroughly rusty wire ring

Identify these.

> g - 4 uncursed potions of water
> h - 9 potions of water

Bless these.

